## After Any `prisma/schema.prisma` Change — Agent Runs the Restart

Whenever the agent edits `prisma/schema.prisma`, it MUST immediately restart the dev server — never ask Phil to do it:

```bash
npm run dev:kill
npx prisma generate
git pull origin dev && npm run dev &
sleep 8
curl -s http://localhost:<PORT>/api/health
```

## Starting the Dev Server — Required Pre-flight

Always `git pull origin dev` first before `npm run dev`. This is unconditional.
